HTMLDocs (Emil Zeller) - HTML pages as Oberon documents: headings, paragraphs, lists, fonts,
links; tables, forms and images come with gadgets-htmltables, -htmlforms, -htmlimages (the section
HTMLTags of Oberon.Text), pages from the web with gadgets-httpdocs

  Desktops.OpenDoc page.html       a page (html = HTMLDocs.NewDoc in Documents of Oberon.Text)
